{"id": "34481", "title": "亲亲大色狼", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 37, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34481.htm", "intro": "英俊潇洒、风采俊逸的蓝公子非,这回居然踢到了前所未有的大铁板！他好心地收容这名其貌不扬的女子,还三不五时地好言慰问,她不感激也就罢了,嘴角还老是挂著一抹……不屑的冷笑？！我咧！这怎么不教他怒气冲天、暴跳如雷！更可恨的是与她唇枪舌战起来,他总是落居下风！嗯呃……不过这女人愈是嘲讽他、冷淡他,他就愈对她著迷哪……难、难、难不成他有被虐的特殊癖好？！ ……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34481", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2187978.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2187979.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2187980.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2187981.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2187982.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2187983.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2187984.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2187985.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2187986.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2187987.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2187988.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2187989.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2187990.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2187991.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2187992.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2187993.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2187994.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2187995.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2187996.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2187997.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2187998.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2187999.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2188000.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2188001.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2188002.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "f